# Raw library inventories and scans, anywhere in the tree.
#
# These are complete listings of real music folders: absolute local paths, the
# whole machine-specific directory structure, and per-track private metadata.
# The root-only patterns above did not cover the nested per-folder copies that
# the survey pipeline actually writes (handoff/.../<folder>/inventory.json),
# and 143 MB of them reached HEAD before this was noticed. See
# handoff/session-2026-08-15/survey/REMOVED-INVENTORIES.md.
#
# Plans, undo logs and result files stay tracked -- those are the audit
# evidence of what a run DID, which an inventory is not.
**/inventory.json
**/inventory.csv
**/tracks.json
**/full-inventory/
**/post-apply-inventory/

# Per-run mutation artifacts, anywhere in the tree.
**/*-recovery-*.jsonl
**/backup-manifest.json
**/*-backup-manifest.json
